Mbed TLS
--------

The panel verifies the release signature of a panel image with Mbed TLS
(shared/fwupdate/fw_sign.c). The panel build links the copy that ESP-IDF
ships (release 3.6.x). The host test build compiles Mbed TLS 3.6.2 from a
source tree or from the release tarball that CMake downloads and checks
against its SHA-256 (test/host/CMakeLists.txt). No Mbed TLS source file is
stored in this repository.

